步骤 20:
- 目的: 生成PNG图片的ASCII艺术表示，以手动识别图片中显示的数字序列
- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "生成PNG图片的ASCII艺术表示，以手动识别图片中显示的数字序列", "arguments": {"code": "from PIL import Image\n\ntry:\n    # 打开图片\n    img = Image.open('/home/gem/workspace/attachments/the_numbers.png')\n    img = img.convert('L')  # 转换为灰度\n    width, height = img.size\n    \n    # 获取像素数据\n    pixels = list(img.getdata())\n    \n    # 确定阈值（假设图片是黑白的）\n    # 自动计算平均灰度作为阈值\n    threshold = 128\n    \n    # 构建 ASCII 字符串\n    output = []\n    for y in range(height):\n        row = []\n        for x in range(width):\n            pixel_value = pixels[y * width + x]\n            if pixel_value < threshold:\n                row.append('#') # 文字/数字部分\n            else:\n                row.append('.') # 背景\n        # 过滤掉全背景的行，只打印有内容的行\n        if set(row) != {'.'}:\n            output.append(''.join(row))\n    \n    # 打印结果\n    print(f\"Generated ASCII Art ({len(output)} lines):\")\n    for line in output:\n        print(line)\n        \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"Error: {e}\")"}}
